---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Manages an environment's database and its backups

Usage: db [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show     Shows the environment's database, if it has one
  backups  Lists the database's backups and its latest restore
  backup   Asks for a backup of the database now
  restore  Puts a backup back over the database, replacing everything written since; requires `<project>/<environment>` as confirmation
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

  -h, --help
          Print help
